[[Menethil Bay]] is a portion of the [[Great Sea]] off the west coast of central [[Eastern Kingdoms]], mostly noted by travelers on the western coast of the [[Wetlands]] around [[Menethil Harbor]]. It is crawling with [[crocolisks]] of various ages and sizes, often hunted for their fine leather.

